/doc/helpdir/spell
==================

DESCRIPTION
===========

Currently, Darkwind does not support spells for players without guilds.
The exception to this rule is for unguilded newbies who can use the spells
"ncot", "nkick, "npunch" and "nheal". See individual help files for details.

